  <SequenceName>k__BackingField: 1-2A
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Hey hey! Not a bad premiere!
  - speaker: 0
    text: "Beginner\u2019s luck."
  - speaker: 1
    text: Ooo is that a head tilt of approval I see?
  - speaker: 0
    text: "YOU can\u2019t SEE anything."
  - speaker: 1
    text: Cmooooon loosen up a little.
  - speaker: 1
    text: "You gotta really get into it, start using that big ol\u2019 brain of yours."
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Don\u2019t even get me started on how the flying fruit could be a metaphor
      for\u2026"
  - speaker: 0
    text: "\u201CHey\u201D"
  - speaker: 0
    text: "\u201CThat thing just appeared in my alley.\u201D"
  - speaker: 0
    text: "\u201CI can\u2019t talk to it, move it, nothing.\u201D"
  - speaker: 0
    text: Did it just, look at me? Or did it look at you?
  - speaker: 0
    text: Take care of it
